## Tests

See [docs/TESTING.md](docs/TESTING.md) for the full guide. Short version:

- **Tags:** `@smoke` (app shell), `@api-only` (no browser), `@live-api` (real upstreams,
  skipped in CI), `@wip` (excluded everywhere), plus one tag per domain.
- **API modes:** `fixture` (replay, default, CI), `live` (real upstreams), `record` (live +
  save fixtures). Re-record with IssueFlow `e2e.sh --record` and commit the fixtures.
- **Coverage gate:** {{COVERAGE_GATE}}, enforced in CI.
- **Stale tests** are updated to the new requirement, never weakened to pass.

## CI

`{{CI_FILE}}`: lint → security → unit (version matrix) → coverage → e2e (fixture mode) →
summary gate. {{NIGHTLY_NOTE}}

### CI troubleshooting

| Failure | Fix |
| --- | --- |
| Lint / format | `preflight.sh --fix` in the worktree, commit what it changed |
| Type check | add the types; never blanket-ignore |
| Unit test | run the single failing test locally with the command above |
| Coverage below gate | add tests for the uncovered lines, not exclusions |
| E2E | read the server log step in CI, reproduce with IssueFlow `e2e.sh` |
| Lockfile out of sync | re-run the install command and commit the lockfile(s) |

